      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Quiet supporting action with a circular play icon.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text\">How it works<span class=\"ds-play\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 11 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m2 1 8 5-8 5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-text{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;min-height:48px;padding:14px 21px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);font:700 12px var(--font-sans),sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,box-shadow .2s;padding-inline:0;gap:10px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink)}.ds-text:hover{color:var(--color-primary);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.ds-play{width:25px;height:25px;border:1px solid #bbc9bb;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-text:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #428764;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "Labeled search with wrapper focus treatment.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"m16 16 4 4\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search majors or skills\" placeholder=\"Search majors or skills…\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid #dbe2d6;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:280px;height:44px;padding-inline:14px;color:var(--color-muted)}.ds-search:focus-within{outline:2px solid #428764;outline-offset:2px}.ds-search svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-search input{width:100%;min-width:0;border:0;outline:0;color:var(--color-ink);background:transparent;font:11px var(--font-sans),sans-serif;caret-color:var(--color-primary)}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--color-muted)}"
    },
    {
